{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f7efe6; /* warm parchment */
      --accent:#7a4b2b; /* earthen clay */
      --muted:#8b6f5b;
      --card:#fff7f0;
      --glass: rgba(250,245,242,0.8);
      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(122,75,43,0.12);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background: var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat 0 0;
      color:#3b2b24;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
    }
    header{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      padding:20px 28px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.4));
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.06);
      position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);z-index:20;
    }
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#b27b61);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a.active{color:var(--accent)}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:0 20px}

    .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;align-items:start}

    .card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted)}

    .contact-form label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:#4a342b}
    .contact-form input,.contact-form textarea,.contact-form select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eadbd0;background:transparent}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #d9c3b6;color:var(--accent)}

    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    .event-mini{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(122,75,43,0.08);margin-bottom:10px}
    .event-mini .when{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    .list{margin-top:12px}

    .packing-list{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.06)}

    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(14,12,11,0.36);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
    .modal{width:100%;max-width:720px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)}
    .steps{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .step{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff6f3;border:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.04);text-align:center}
    .breath-visual{height:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .circle{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);opacity:0.12;transition:transform 800ms ease}

    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#6b4f42;margin-top:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.12)}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">SB</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Calendar</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Personal Sessions</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Contributions</a>
      <a href="about.html">The Guide</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Curiosities</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a class="active" href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="split">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Connect & Prepare</h1>
          <p class="lead">Reach out, hold an intention, or try a moment here now. If you want to inquire about a private gathering or check availability, use the quick form — or test a guided pause below.</p>

          <div class="event-mini" aria-hidden>
            <div>
              <div class="when">Next open seat</div>
              <div class="meta">Date: <strong id="next-date">Mar 7, 2026</strong> · Time: <strong id="next-time">18:30</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="event-select">Choose a gathering</label>
            <select id="event-select" aria-label="Choose an event"></select>

            <div class="meta" id="seat-info">Seats left: —</div>

            <label for="seat-count">How many seats to hold</label>
            <select id="seat-count">
              <option value="1">1</option>
              <option value="2">2</option>
              <option value="3">3</option>
              <option value="4">4</option>
            </select>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
              <button id="hold-seat" class="btn">Hold seat (local)</button>
              <button id="generate-pack" class="btn secondary">Prepare packing list</button>
            </div>

            <div class="packing-list card" id="packing-output" style="display:none"></div>
          </div>

          <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.06);margin:18px 0" />

          <div>
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Try a guided pause</h3>
            <p class="meta">Short, guided: breathing, journaling, and setting a brief intention. No audio files — pure code.</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:8px">
              <button id="try-breathe" class="btn">Try it now — Breath</button>
              <button id="try-journal" class="btn secondary">Try it now — Journal</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:14px">
            <strong>Contraindications:</strong> If you are pregnant, have epilepsy, severe cardiovascular conditions, recent head injury, uncontrolled hypertension, or are under medical care for a serious mental-health condition, please consult a clinician before joining. Close contact or loud vibration may not be suitable for some medical implants. This page provides no medical advice; if in doubt, seek professional guidance.
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Contact</h3>
          <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" required />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />

            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" />

            <label for="message">Message or inquiry</label>
            <textarea id="message" rows="4" placeholder="I am interested in..." required></textarea>

            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label style="font-size:13px"><input id="consent" type="checkbox" required /> I agree to be contacted about scheduling and billing.</label>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button id="send" class="btn">Send inquiry</button>
              <button id="clear" class="btn secondary" type="button">Clear</button>
            </div>

            <div id="form-msg" class="meta" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
          </form>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick contact</h3>
          <div class="meta">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class="meta">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div class="meta">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>

          <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.06);margin:14px 0" />

          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Upcoming (local preview)</h4>
          <ul id="mini-calendar" style="padding-left:18px;margin:0;color:var(--muted)"></ul>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <button id="open-reserve" class="btn">Reserve a private moment</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Notes</h4>
          <p class="meta">If you want a bespoke invitation for a group, mention size and a general date. We reply within 48 hours during business days.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Contact: {{EMAIL}} · {{PHONE}}</div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal for guided practice -->
  <div id="modal" class="modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800" id="modal-title">Guided Pause</div>
          <div id="modal-sub" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">A short practice to reorient your breath and intention.</div>
        </div>
        <div><button id="modal-close" class="btn secondary">Close</button></div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 240px;gap:12px">
        <div>
          <div style="margin-top:6px" id="modal-body"></div>
          <div class="steps" id="modal-steps" style="margin-top:14px"></div>

          <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button id="modal-next" class="btn">Next</button>
            <button id="modal-prev" class="btn secondary">Back</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff7f2,#fff);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Live preview</div>
            <div class="breath-visual" aria-hidden>
              <div class="circle" id="breath-circle"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">A gentle visual to sync with the guidance.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // --- Utilities & data ---
    const events = [
      {id:1,title:'Evening Sound Pause',date:'2026-03-07',time:'18:30',seats:6,notes:'30–40 min, community space'},
      {id:2,title:'Midday Mini Session',date:'2026-03-09',time:'12:15',seats:4,notes:'20 min, bring mat'},
      {id:3,title:'Weekend Rest Intensive',date:'2026-03-14',time:'10:00',seats:10,notes:'90 min, blankets welcome'}
    ];

    // DOM refs
    const eventSelect = document.getElementById('event-select');
    const seatInfo = document.getElementById('seat-info');
    const seatCount = document.getElementById('seat-count');
    const holdSeat = document.getElementById('hold-seat');
    const packBtn = document.getElementById('generate-pack');
    const packingOutput = document.getElementById('packing-output');
    const miniCal = document.getElementById('mini-calendar');
    const nextDate = document.getElementById('next-date');
    const nextTime = document.getElementById('next-time');

    // populate events
    function refreshEvents(){
      eventSelect.innerHTML = '';
      events.forEach(ev=>{
        const opt = document.createElement('option');
        opt.value = ev.id;
        opt.textContent = ev.date + ' — ' + ev.title + ' (' + ev.time + ')';
        eventSelect.appendChild(opt);
      });
      updateSeatInfo();
      // mini calendar
      miniCal.innerHTML = '';
      events.slice(0,5).forEach(ev=>{
        const li = document.createElement('li');
        li.textContent = ev.date + ' — ' + ev.title + ' · seats ' + ev.seats;
        miniCal.appendChild(li);
      });
      // next event
      const next = events[0];
      nextDate.textContent = next.date;
      nextTime.textContent = next.time;
    }

    function updateSeatInfo(){
      const ev = events.find(e=>e.id==eventSelect.value);
      seatInfo.textContent = 'Seats left: ' + (ev ? ev.seats : '—');
    }

    eventSelect.addEventListener('change', updateSeatInfo);

    holdSeat.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const ev = events.find(e=>e.id==eventSelect.value);
      const count = parseInt(seatCount.value,10)||1;
      if(!ev) return;
      if(ev.seats>=count){
        ev.seats -= count;
        updateSeatInfo();
        refreshEvents();
        alert('Local hold placed for ' + count + ' seat(s) on ' + ev.date + ' — this is a local simulation.');
      } else {
        alert('Not enough seats available.');
      }
    });

    packBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const ev = events.find(e=>e.id==eventSelect.value);
      const count = parseInt(seatCount.value,10)||1;
      if(!ev){packingOutput.style.display='none';return}
      const list = generatePackingList(ev,count);
      packingOutput.style.display='block';
      packingOutput.innerHTML = '<strong>Suggested packing list</strong><ul style="margin:8px 0 0 18px">' + list.map(i=>'<li>'+i+'</li>').join('') + '</ul>';
    });

    function generatePackingList(ev,count){
      // base items
      const base = ['Yoga mat or thick blanket','Light cushion for sitting','Water bottle','Warm socks or shawl'];
      // modify by duration/notes
      if(ev.notes.toLowerCase().includes('90')) base.push('Extra blanket for longer rest');
      if(ev.notes.toLowerCase().includes('bring mat')) base.push('Thin yoga mat (if you have one)');
      // group items
      const personal = ['Small journal and pen','Optional eye mask','Comfortable layers (easy to remove)'];
      // per-person extras
      const extras = (count>1) ? ['Consider a bag to keep belongings together'] : [];
      // gentle guidance
      const advice = ['Arrive 10 minutes early to settle','Avoid heavy meals just before the session'];
      return [...base,...personal,...extras,...advice];
    }

    // --- Contact form (local) ---
    const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
    const formMsg = document.getElementById('form-msg');
    document.getElementById('send').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email || !msg){ formMsg.textContent = 'Please fill the required fields.'; return; }
      formMsg.textContent = 'Thanks — your message is held locally for this demo. We would reply to ' + email + '.';
      form.reset();
    });
    document.getElementById('clear').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ form.reset(); formMsg.textContent=''; });

    // --- Modal guided practice ---
    const modal = document.getElementById('modal');
    const modalTitle = document.getElementById('modal-title');
    const modalSub = document.getElementById('modal-sub');
    const modalBody = document.getElementById('modal-body');
    const modalSteps = document.getElementById('modal-steps');
    const modalNext = document.getElementById('modal-next');
    const modalPrev = document.getElementById('modal-prev');
    const modalClose = document.getElementById('modal-close');
    const breathCircle = document.getElementById('breath-circle');

    let practice = null;
    const practices = {
      breath: {
        title:'Box Breath — 3 rounds',
        sub:'Breathe in 4 — hold 4 — out 4 — hold 4. Repeat gently.',
        steps:[
          {label:'Get comfortable',desc:'Sit or recline. Let your jaw release.'},
          {label:'Inhale (4s)',desc:'Breathe in slowly through the nose — count to 4.'},
          {label:'Hold (4s)',desc:'Soft hold. Notice sensations.'},
          {label:'Exhale (4s)',desc:'Slowly release through the mouth or nose.'},
          {label:'Hold (4s)',desc:'Soft pause. Then repeat.'}
        ],
        rounds:3
      },
      journal: {
        title:'Two-minute Scribe',
        sub:'Write freely — no editing. Two prompts, one minute each.',
        steps:[
          {label:'Prompt 1',desc:'What would you like to leave behind from the week?'},
          {label:'Prompt 2',desc:'What is an intention you want to carry forward?'}
        ],
        rounds:2
      }
    };

    function openPractice(kind){
      practice = practices[kind];
      modalTitle.textContent = practice.title;
      modalSub.textContent = practice.sub;
      currentStep = 0;
      renderStep();
      modal.style.display = 'flex';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
    }

    function closePractice(){
      modal.style.display='none';
      modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      stopBreathAnimation();
      stopTone();
    }

    document.getElementById('try-breathe').addEventListener('click', ()=> openPractice('breath'));
    document.getElementById('try-journal').addEventListener('click', ()=> openPractice('journal'));
    document.getElementById('open-reserve').addEventListener('click', ()=> window.location.href='book.html');

    modalClose.addEventListener('click', closePractice);
    modal.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) closePractice(); });

    let currentStep = 0;
    let breathInterval = null;

    function renderStep(){
      modalSteps.innerHTML = '';
      practice.steps.forEach((s,i)=>{
        const el = document.createElement('div');
        el.className = 'step';
        el.innerHTML = '<div style="font-weight:700">' + s.label + '</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">' + s.desc + '</div>';
        if(i===currentStep) el.style.boxShadow = 'inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(122,75,43,0.06)';
        modalSteps.appendChild(el);
      });

      // body content and controls
      const step = practice.steps[currentStep];
      modalBody.innerHTML = '<div style="font-weight:700">' + step.label + '</div><div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">' + step.desc + '</div>';

      // special behavior for breathing
      if(practice===practices.breath){
        startBoxBreath();
      } else {
        stopBreathAnimation();
      }

      // for journaling play a soft tone to mark transitions
      if(practice===practices.journal){
        playTone(220,0.12);
      }
    }

    modalNext.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      if(currentStep < practice.steps.length - 1){ currentStep++; renderStep(); }
      else { closePractice(); alert('Practice complete — you may open the page contact form or continue with your day.'); }
    });
    modalPrev.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ if(currentStep>0){ currentStep--; renderStep(); } });

    // breathing animation (visual only)
    function startBoxBreath(){
      stopBreathAnimation();
      let phase=0; // inhale, hold, exhale, hold
      const timing = 1000; // base per-second scale
      const dur = 4000; // each phase ms
      breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(0.6)';
      breathInterval = setInterval(()=>{
        phase = (phase+1)%4;
        if(phase===0){ // inhale
          breathCircle.style.transition = 'transform 4s ease-in-out';
          breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(1.35)';
          playTone(440,0.06);
        } else if(phase===1){ // hold
          breathCircle.style.transition = 'transform 4s linear';
          breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(1.35)';
        } else if(phase===2){ // exhale
          breathCircle.style.transition = 'transform 4s ease-in-out';
          breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(0.6)';
          playTone(330,0.06);
        } else { // hold
          breathCircle.style.transition = 'transform 4s linear';
          breathCircle.style.transform = 'scale(0.6)';
        }
      },4000);
    }
    function stopBreathAnimation(){ if(breathInterval){ clearInterval(breathInterval); breathInterval=null; breathCircle.style.transform='scale(0.9)'; } }

    // simple tone via WebAudio
    let audioCtx = null; let osc = null; let gainNode = null;
    function ensureAudio(){ if(!audioCtx) audioCtx = new (window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)(); }
    function playTone(freq,dur){ try{ ensureAudio(); osc = audioCtx.createOscillator(); gainNode = audioCtx.createGain(); osc.type='sine'; osc.frequency.value = freq; gainNode.gain.value=0.0001; osc.connect(gainNode); gainNode.connect(audioCtx.destination); osc.start();
        gainNode.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0.06,audioCtx.currentTime+0.02);
        gainNode.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0.0001,audioCtx.currentTime+dur);
        setTimeout(()=>{ try{ osc.stop(); osc.disconnect(); gainNode.disconnect(); }catch(e){} }, dur*1000);
    }catch(e){}
    }
    function stopTone(){ try{ if(osc){osc.stop();osc.disconnect();} if(gainNode){gainNode.disconnect();} }catch(e){} osc=null;gainNode=null; }

    // init
    refreshEvents();
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // accessibility: keyboard close for modal
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{
      if(e.key==='Escape') closePractice();
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and local interactive features — chunk 4

This bundle contains two files for the sound bath site (chunk 4):

Files
- contact.html — The contact / connect page with local interactive widgets.
- README.md — This file.

Highlights
- Unique site voice and layout: earthy_warm + mystic_modern.
- No external assets, fonts, or CDNs referenced.
- All text uses placeholders where appropriate: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Interactive features implemented (local, client-side only)
1) Event seat selector (simulated)
   - Select an event from a curated local list.
   - Choose number of seats to hold; "Hold seat (local)" reduces available seats locally.
   - A mini calendar lists upcoming events.

2) Packing-list generator
   - "Prepare packing list" generates a suggested packing checklist based on selected event and seat count.
   - Tailors suggestions to event notes (e.g., longer sessions include extra blanket advice).

3) Two "Try it now" guided practice entry points
   - "Try it now — Breath": Opens a modal with a box-breathing guided visual and subtle tones generated with the Web Audio API. Visual breathing circle animates (no external media).
   - "Try it now — Journal": Opens a modal offering two short journaling prompts with a gentle tone transition.
   - Both runs purely in JavaScript, no network calls.

4) Contact form (local demo)
   - Simple form with required fields. Submission is simulated locally and shows a confirmation message.

Accessibility & UX
- Modal is keyboard-friendly (Escape closes it). Buttons are labeled and interactive elements are focusable.
- Contraindications disclaimer included responsibly in the contact card.

Nav labels
- Custom navigation labels differ from default templates: Gatherings, Calendar, Personal Sessions, Contributions, The Guide, Curiosities, Reserve, Connect.

Notes for developers
- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for the background pattern. Ensure that file exists in the project tree (a unique SVG pattern should be created for visual richness).
- The interactive features are strictly local: no server or network integration is implemented here.
- Tone generation uses the Web Audio API; some browsers may require a user gesture to enable sound (the buttons provide such gestures).

Testing
- Open contact.html in a browser (double-click or via a local server).
- Use the event selector and hold seats to observe local state changes.
- Click "Prepare packing list" to see the dynamic checklist.
- Click "Try it now — Breath" or "Try it now — Journal" to open the guided modal and navigate steps.
- Test form submission (local simulation) using the "Send inquiry" button.

Placeholders to replace in production
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Contraindications & Ethics
- The page includes a clear contraindications block. If you adapt copy or features for production, maintain or expand the medical/clinical disclaimers and consider adding an explicit consent flow where needed.

Design notes
- Colors and layout use a warm, earthen palette. The layout is responsive and should work comfortably on phones and desktop.

If you need the matching pattern SVG or further pages in this layout family, request the next chunk and include an assets/img/pattern.svg to complete the visual system."}
